TI  - Evaluating 3D Reconstruction: A Side-by-Side Comparison of NeRF and Gaussian Splatting in Indoor and Outdoor Environments
JO  - Engineering, Technology & Applied Science Research 16(2), 33736–33745
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/04/04
